  "reason": "Add Rhythm register operations to the YM2608 FM/SSG recorder and shared audio-clock reservation path. Preserve per-drum ownership and physical register snapshots while retaining authored packed pan/level metadata under standalone monitor mute. ROM transfers, ADPCM transfer/timing, native cores, binary audio renderers, gain values and historical measurements remain unchanged. Exact predecessor restoration and default-PCM parity are checked separately.",
